      "score": 0.425,
      "guidance": "Target ≥7:1 text contrast and avoid thin weights and pale tints (glare washes them out); prefer light UI on white or very high-contrast dark, not mid-tone surfaces; make the current state glanceable (large status word plus colour plus icon, readable at arm's length in two seconds); ≥48 dp targets with ≥12 dp spacing and no precision gestures when gloves are likely; put the next action in thumb reach; large numerals for counts and readings; keep the screen usable one-handed and interruptible (state survives backgrounding).",
